    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine, Trade, and Prosper!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your mining freighter and delve into asteroid clusters to uncover valuable ores, rare metals, and alien artifacts. Master the balance of risk and reward as you trade your findings to upgrade your ship and expand your horizons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/9d6c4beff6d188ea35c69ea6e11ee32e.poster.avif?t=1742226188\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/9d6c4beff6d188ea35c69ea6e11ee32e.webm?t=1742226188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/9d6c4beff6d188ea35c69ea6e11ee32e.mp4?t=1742226188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine Your Way to Riches!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your spacecraft and journey into the unknown reaches of space. Dig into asteroids to uncover precious gems and rare metals, promising great riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/e5ca900472cdd5e511f3ae2a19cf1ea2.poster.avif?t=1742226188\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/e5ca900472cdd5e511f3ae2a19cf1ea2.webm?t=1742226188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/e5ca900472cdd5e511f3ae2a19cf1ea2.mp4?t=1742226188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Wild Edges of Space!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous asteroid belts, evade lurking alien predators, and fend off opportunistic pirates. With limited fuel and supplies, every decision matters in this lawless frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/e6743c155ee27cb82eedc0bc179beaee.poster.avif?t=1742226188\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/e6743c155ee27cb82eedc0bc179beaee.webm?t=1742226188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835390/extras/e6743c155ee27cb82eedc0bc179beaee.mp4?t=1742226188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your mining ships with powerful upgrades and specialized equipment. From reinforced hulls to advanced thrusters and weapons, tailor your vessels to suit your strategy and survive the harshness of space. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Diverse Cosmic landscapes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on adventures across varied celestial environments, each with its own challenges and wonders. From icy expanses to volatile volcanic realms, the universe awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy the Abyss, Discover the Beyond!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is unforgiving, but it rewards the bold. Will you risk it all to push beyond the brink? The riches, mysteries, and dangers of the cosmos await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now!</h2>",
